  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/31bdc6cf-09f6-4b5a-8bed-d2ed091e8b9c.png\" style=\"width:1.42708in;height:1.57361in\" /><br />Equation of the line <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Given,&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math><br />or, <math><mn>5</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></math><br />or, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> it follows that line <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> i.e., <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> passes through the fixed point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
